---
// Ekegusii language (decision #122): the first goal is an open, documented text and speech dataset.
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../../../components/PageHead.astro';
import CommunityRules from '../../../components/CommunityRules.astro';
---
<Base title="Ekegusii language" description="An open Ekegusii text and speech dataset, built with the community.">
  <PageHead title="Ekegusii language" lead="Phones and computers barely understand Ekegusii, because so little of it has been recorded. We are building that record together." />
  <div class="stack-lg" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:760px">
    <section class="stack">
      <h2>The first goal: a dataset</h2>
      <p>We are collecting Ekegusii as it is spoken and written: stories, proverbs, songs and everyday speech. Each piece is written down, translated, and recorded with who shared it and what they agreed to.</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Collect.</strong> Volunteers record speakers who agree to take part.</li>
        <li><strong>Write down and translate.</strong> Speakers of Ekegusii check every transcript.</li>
        <li><strong>Document.</strong> Each item carries its source, its consent and its review.</li>
        <li><strong>Share.</strong> The dataset is published for the community, schools and researchers. The licence is still being set.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Tools such as a translator come later, and only from recordings whose speakers gave a separate yes to that use.</p>
      <p class="callout"><span><strong>Nothing has been published yet.</strong> The first recordings are being planned.</span></p>
    </section>
    <p><a href="/community/share/">Volunteer to record, or offer a recording</a></p>
    <CommunityRules />
  </div>
</Base>
